      "message": "According to DSP0248, Table 5.1, I found only `enabled` for `setStateEffecterEnables`\u0027s `opState`. \nhttps://www.dmtf.org/sites/default/files/standards/documents/DSP0248_1.3.0.pdf\n\nQ: Please explain how are these defined.",
