      "writtenOn": "2026-11-20T05:33:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks for catching this. Table 51 defines the effecterOperationalState values as { enabled, disabled\u003d2, unavailable }, a subset of the GetStateEffecterStates values, so 1 (enabled-noUpdatePending) is not valid for this command. I had reused the GetStateEffecterStates enumeration. In the latest patch set I replaced the two enabled macros with a single PLDM_PLATFORM_SET_STATE_EFFECTER_ENABLES_ENABLED (0), and only 0, 2 and 3 are accepted now.",
      "parentUuid": "b3910c6a_c6308140",
